---
/* =========================================================================
   WIDE TOE BOX PAGE — rebuilt 19 Oct 2026 as a 1:1 structural rip of
   consumertopreviews.com/best-barefoot-shoes3.html (~US$93k/mo, same offer 568).
   Rip map: advertorial-system/offers/grounded/research/RIP-TEARDOWNS-2026-10-19.md
   Google ad group "Wide toe box" (exact): best wide toe box shoes.
